    "Health data is not sent to OpenChat's developer and not used for advertising. Debug bundles leave it out. The answers stay in your chats on this device until you delete them. Health data never goes to iCloud: Apple Health can't be used while chat sync is on.": {
      "extractionState": "stale"
    },
    "Health data never goes to iCloud. In chats where the assistant read Apple Health, the replies, summaries, figures and artifacts can repeat what it read, so chat sync can only be turned on after those chats are deleted from this device. Apple Health can't be used here while chat sync is on.": {},
