    "The assistant asks to read Apple Health.": {},
    "The assistant can read the Apple Health data you allow, to answer questions about your own health and fitness. It never writes to Health. iOS asks the first time a chat reads each type; change it any time in the Settings app > Health > Data Access & Devices > OmniChat. A chat turns Apple Health on or off from the + menu.": {},
    "The assistant can read the Apple Health data you allow, to answer questions about your own health and fitness. It never writes to Health. iOS asks the first time a chat reads each type; change it any time in the Settings app > Health > Data Access & Devices > OpenChat. A chat turns Apple Health on or off from the + menu.": {
      "extractionState": "stale"
    },
    "The assistant is told not to diagnose, and to suggest a healthcare professional when values look concerning.": {},
    "The assistant wants to save this skill. Its name and description will be listed in new chats, and the assistant will follow it when it loads it. Web pages can contain instructions meant to mislead the assistant: save it only if it looks right to you.": {},
