    "The model can open pages in a hidden browser on this device with browser_open, click, type and scroll in them, and run JavaScript with browser_eval. It can't reach your local network. When the model needs you to sign in, it shows you the page; the sign-in is kept for later. Skills teach the model tasks like finding places on Naver; it saves new ones only when you approve. These are the defaults for new chats; turn tools on or off in a chat from the + menu.": {},
    "The model can put small tables, charts, choices and forms in its answers, drawn as part of the chat. Pressing a button or sending a form answers with your choice. A chat can turn interactive views on or off from the + menu.": {},
    "The model can read what is said in a YouTube video with video_transcript: its captions, uploaded or auto-generated, read on this device. Videos without captions can't be read. A chat can turn video transcripts on or off from the + menu.": {},
    "The model can run Python code on this device with run_python (Pyodide %@). Packages such as numpy, sympy and pandas are downloaded the first time they are used and kept for later.": {
      "extractionState": "stale"
    },
    "The model can run Python code on this device with run_python (Pyodide %@). Packages such as numpy, sympy and pandas are downloaded the first time they are used and kept for later. A chat can turn Python on or off from the + menu.": {
      "extractionState": "stale"
    },
    "The model can run Python code on this device with run_python (Pyodide %@). numpy, pandas and matplotlib are bundled and work offline. Other packages cannot be installed. A chat can turn Python on or off from the + menu.": {},
    "The model can run commands and move files on your servers over SSH, and save the passwords and keys you give it in the Keychain on this device. A chat turns SSH on or off from the + menu. Each command connects anew; a connection drops soon after OmniChat leaves the screen.": {},
    "The model can run commands and move files on your servers over SSH, and save the passwords and keys you give it in the Keychain on this device. A chat turns SSH on or off from the + menu. Each command connects anew; a connection drops soon after OpenChat leaves the screen.": {
      "extractionState": "stale"
    },
